## Links & Images

### Links

[Example link with text](https://www.example.com) and an autolink: https://www.example.com

### Images

![](/favicon.svg)

## Quotes

```quote
A small syntax can make a large pause.

- Format in one breath
- Preview as you write
- Keep every idea close
```

## Code

### Inline Code

In Python, use `print("Hello, Markdown!")` to print text.

### Code Blocks

```fon
{
  identifier = `reference.fuyeor.com`
  params = {
    locale = .en
    module = `ffm`
    slug = [`tutorials`, `overview`]
  }
}
```

## Tables

| Left-aligned | Center-aligned | Right-aligned |
| :--- | :---: | ---: |
| Content | Content | Content |
| Longer content | Longer content | Longer content |

